### Placebo floor

The cited rate on placebo intents, questions your pages cannot answer. An unbranded intent whose cited interval overlaps it is indistinguishable from placebo.

| Floor | Value (95% interval) | Statistics |
|---|---|---|
| Placebo floor | {{ e.placebo_floor|fmt_pct }} | ({{ e.placebo_floor|stats(interval=false, note=false) }}) |
