Note on the placebo floor: {{ e.placebo_floor.note }}
{% endif %}

### Noise floor

How much answers move when nothing changed: the overlap (Jaccard) of the URLs cited by repeats of the same wording, within one burst and between bursts, and the flip rate. A later change smaller than this is hard to tell from noise.

| Measure | Value (95% interval) | Statistics |
|---|---|---|
{% for measure, meaning, mv, is_jaccard in e|noise %}
| {{ measure }}: {{ meaning }} | {{ mv|fmt_pct }} | ({{ mv|stats("pair", is_jaccard, false) }}) |
{% endfor %}

